            "review_text": "SBFreak415\nDa Nang, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nXoi Hanoi in Da Nang\nJul 2014 • Solo\nCool little place, good food, owner speaks english which was a big + for me. This was the first place where I was able to find dark/black beer in Da Nang, none of the bars I have been to seem to have any and thats all I really like to drink. After my meal they gave me free ice cream, must have been my good looks :)\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2014",
